Route25_Text_JoeyIntro::
    .string "Local TRAINERS come here to\n"
    .string "practice.$"

Route25_Text_JoeyDefeat::
    .string "You're decent.$"

Route25_Text_JoeyPostBattle::
    .string "All POKéMON have weaknesses.\n"
    .string "Even the strongest ones.\p"
    .string "That's why it's best to raise\n"
    .string "POKéMON of different types.$"

Route25_Text_DanIntro::
    .string "Dad took me to a great party on\n"
    .string "the S.S. ANNE at VERMILION CITY.$"

Route25_Text_DanDefeat::
    .string "I'm not mad!$"

Route25_Text_DanPostBattle::
    .string "On the S.S. ANNE, I saw TRAINERS\n"
    .string "from around the world.$"

Route25_Text_FlintIntro::
    .string "The cape water changes depth fast.\p"
    .string "A FISHERMAN learns to read those\n"
    .string "shifts before casting.$"

Route25_Text_FlintBridgeRematchIntro::
    .string "The current shifted again.\p"
    .string "Let's see if your battle rhythm\n"
    .string "shifted too!$"

Route25_Text_FlintDefeat::
    .string "Line snapped!$"

Route25_Text_FlintPostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 25 looks peaceful, but the\n"
    .string "water keeps changing under it.\p"
    .string "That's why the fishing stays good.$"

Route25_Text_KelseyIntro::
    .string "Hi!\n"
    .string "My boyfriend is cool!$"

Route25_Text_KelseyDefeat::
    .string "My conditioning isn't the best…$"

Route25_Text_KelseyPostBattle::
    .string "I wish my boyfriend was as good\n"
    .string "as you.$"

Route25_Text_ChadIntro::
    .string "I had this feeling…\n"
    .string "I knew I had to battle you!$"

Route25_Text_ChadDefeat::
    .string "I knew I'd lose, too!$"

Route25_Text_ChadPostBattle::
    .string "If your POKéMON gets confused,\n"
    .string "switch it out.\p"
    .string "That's a good tactic.$"

Route25_Text_HaleyIntro::
    .string "My friend has many cute POKéMON.\n"
    .string "I'm so jealous!$"

Route25_Text_HaleyDefeat::
    .string "I'm not so jealous!$"

Route25_Text_HaleyPostBattle::
    .string "You came from MT. MOON?\n"
    .string "May I have a CLEFAIRY?$"

Route25_Text_FranklinIntro::
    .string "I just got down from MT. MOON,\n"
    .string "but I've still got gas in the tank!$"

Route25_Text_FranklinDefeat::
    .string "You worked hard!$"

Route25_Text_FranklinPostBattle::
    .string "Drat!\n"
    .string "A ZUBAT bit me back in that cave.$"

Route25_Text_NobIntro::
    .string "I'm off to see a POKéMANIAC's\n"
    .string "collection at the cape.$"

Route25_Text_NobDefeat::
    .string "You done got me, and real good,\n"
    .string "too!$"

Route25_Text_NobPostBattle::
    .string "The POKéMANIAC sure lives up to\n"
    .string "his name.\p"
    .string "His collection includes many rare\n"
    .string "species of POKéMON.$"

Route25_Text_WayneIntro::
    .string "You're going to see BILL?\n"
    .string "First, we battle!$"

Route25_Text_WayneDefeat::
    .string "You're something.$"

Route25_Text_WaynePostBattle::
    .string "The trail below is a shortcut to\n"
    .string "CERULEAN CITY.$"

Route25_Text_SeaCottageSign::
    .string "SEA COTTAGE\n"
    .string "CERULEAN CAPE RESEARCH OUTPOST$"

Route25_Text_MistyHighHopesAboutThisPlace::
    .string "The cape is a fine place to study\n"
    .string "shoreline POKéMON.\p"
    .string "MISTY used to check the currents\n"
    .string "here before heading inland.$"

Route25_Text_AreYouHereAlone::
    .string "The bridge changed everything.\p"
    .string "Now TRAINERS can come from ROUTE\n"
    .string "10 without circling through\l"
    .string "CERULEAN.$"

Route25_Text_FishermanTommyIntro::
    .string "A bridge over good water?\n"
    .string "That's an invitation to cast!$"

Route25_Text_FishermanTommyRematchIntro::
    .string "Back for another cast?\n"
    .string "Let's see what bites!$"

Route25_Text_FishermanTommyDefeat::
    .string "The current got me!$"

Route25_Text_FishermanTommyPostBattle::
    .string "Fish gather where the shore changes\n"
    .string "shape.\p"
    .string "A sandy bank like this is worth\n"
    .string "checking twice.$"

Route25_Text_FishermanTylorIntro::
    .string "The sea breeze reaches all the way\n"
    .string "up here now.$"

Route25_Text_FishermanTylorRematchIntro::
    .string "The tide's turned.\n"
    .string "This one's mine!$"

Route25_Text_FishermanTylorDefeat::
    .string "Washed out!$"

Route25_Text_FishermanTylorPostBattle::
    .string "This bridge turned my quiet spot\n"
    .string "into a proper route.\p"
    .string "Can't complain when the bites are\n"
    .string "this good.$"

Route25_Text_RunningTriathleteMIntro::
    .string "This bridge is perfect for interval\n"
    .string "training! Keep up!$"

Route25_Text_RunningTriathleteMRematchIntro::
    .string "Back on the long bridge?\p"
    .string "Good. I've been timing my laps\n"
    .string "for this rematch!$"

Route25_Text_RunningTriathleteMDefeat::
    .string "Outpaced!$"

Route25_Text_RunningTriathleteMPostBattle::
    .string "The best part of a long run is\n"
    .string "feeling the wind over the water.$"

Route25_Text_RunningTriathleteFIntro::
    .string "No slowing down on the bridge!\n"
    .string "Battle at full stride!$"

Route25_Text_RunningTriathleteFRematchIntro::
    .string "You made it back across the span!\p"
    .string "Let's see if you still have speed\n"
    .string "left for me.$"

Route25_Text_RunningTriathleteFDefeat::
    .string "You found another gear!$"

Route25_Text_RunningTriathleteFPostBattle::
    .string "A straight path, sea air, and a\n"
    .string "good battle. That's training.$"

Route25_Text_TessIntro::
    .string "The cape has open air, soft grass,\n"
    .string "and plenty of passing TRAINERS.\p"
    .string "That's excellent social training\n"
    .string "for young POKéMON.$"

Route25_Text_TessRematchIntro::
    .string "My POKéMON know the cape path\n"
    .string "better now.\p"
    .string "Let's show you how they've grown!$"

Route25_Text_TessDefeat::
    .string "Healthy growth!$"

Route25_Text_TessPostBattle::
    .string "A busy route can be gentle too.\p"
    .string "ROUTE 25 teaches POKéMON to stay\n"
    .string "calm around strangers.$"

Route25_Text_MiraIntro::
    .string "I bring my POKéMON here because\n"
    .string "the bridge breeze keeps them alert.\p"
    .string "Let's see if yours are alert too!$"

Route25_Text_MiraRematchIntro::
    .string "The breeze is back, and so are you.\p"
    .string "Perfect conditions for a rematch!$"

Route25_Text_MiraDefeat::
    .string "Wide awake now!$"

Route25_Text_MiraPostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 25 is good for confidence.\p"
    .string "Every battle here feels like a\n"
    .string "step toward the cape.$"

Route25_Text_DaliaIntro::
    .string "The flowers here lean toward the\n"
    .string "sea breeze.\p"
    .string "Even plants seem curious about\n"
    .string "where this route leads.$"

Route25_Text_DaliaRematchIntro::
    .string "The flowers are leaning again.\p"
    .string "They must have noticed you coming\n"
    .string "back for a rematch.$"

Route25_Text_DaliaDefeat::
    .string "Scattered petals!$"

Route25_Text_DaliaPostBattle::
    .string "A cape garden grows differently.\p"
    .string "Salt air, bright water, and steady\n"
    .string "footsteps all leave a mark.$"

Route25_Text_JoanaIntro::
    .string "I came for the flowers, but stayed\n"
    .string "for the view.\p"
    .string "A battle with the cape behind us\n"
    .string "sounds lovely!$"

Route25_Text_JoanaRematchIntro::
    .string "The view is lovely again.\p"
    .string "Let's make the battle just as\n"
    .string "memorable.$"

Route25_Text_JoanaDefeat::
    .string "Lovely and strong!$"

Route25_Text_JoanaPostBattle::
    .string "From here you can feel CERULEAN\n"
    .string "behind you and the open routes\n"
    .string "ahead.$"

Route25_Text_DanaIntro::
    .string "The posts under this bridge give\n"
    .string "fish places to hide.\p"
    .string "A smart FISHERMAN checks every\n"
    .string "shadow.$"

Route25_Text_DanaRematchIntro::
    .string "Same bridge, new shadows.\p"
    .string "Let's see what kind of battle\n"
    .string "hides here today.$"

Route25_Text_DanaDefeat::
    .string "You saw through it!$"

Route25_Text_DanaPostBattle::
    .string "People look across bridges.\n"
    .string "FISHERMEN look underneath them.$"

Route25_Text_JustinIntro::
    .string "A SCOUT should know when a short\n"
    .string "path becomes a long journey.\p"
    .string "This bridge did that to ROUTE 25.$"

Route25_Text_JustinRematchIntro::
    .string "Still checking the long route?\p"
    .string "Good. A SCOUT respects a path\n"
    .string "that changed.$"

Route25_Text_JustinDefeat::
    .string "You read the path!$"

Route25_Text_JustinPostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 25 used to feel like an end.\p"
    .string "Now it feels like a crossing.$"

Route25_Text_GwenIntro::
    .string "I mark rest spots for TRAINERS\n"
    .string "crossing from CERULEAN to ROUTE 10.\p"
    .string "This one is also good for battles!$"

Route25_Text_GwenRematchIntro::
    .string "You found my rest spot again.\p"
    .string "That means you're ready for\n"
    .string "another battle.$"

Route25_Text_GwenDefeat::
    .string "Well rested!$"

Route25_Text_GwenPostBattle::
    .string "Long connections need quiet places\n"
    .string "where TRAINERS can reset their\n"
    .string "pace.$"

Route25_Text_ValerieIntro::
    .string "The cape path twists just enough\n"
    .string "to hide what comes next.\p"
    .string "A SCOUT learns to enjoy that.$"

Route25_Text_ValerieRematchIntro::
    .string "You came back around the twist.\p"
    .string "Let's see what changed since your\n"
    .string "last pass.$"

Route25_Text_ValerieDefeat::
    .string "No surprise there!$"

Route25_Text_ValeriePostBattle::
    .string "A route with turns invites you to\n"
    .string "slow down and look closely.$"

Route25_Text_RileyIntro::
    .string "I patrol the grass near the bridge\n"
    .string "because people rush through it.\p"
    .string "Rush past me and you'll miss the\n"
    .string "battle!$"

Route25_Text_RileyRematchIntro::
    .string "You didn't rush past this time.\p"
    .string "Good. Let's make the rematch\n"
    .string "count.$"

Route25_Text_RileyDefeat::
    .string "You didn't miss a step!$"

Route25_Text_RileyPostBattle::
    .string "Fast routes still have details.\p"
    .string "A hidden item, a patch of grass,\n"
    .string "a TRAINER waiting sideways.$"

Route25_Text_BlakeIntro::
    .string "The breeze carries flower scents\n"
    .string "farther over water.\p"
    .string "That's why ROUTE 25 feels so fresh.$"

Route25_Text_BlakeRematchIntro::
    .string "The air is fresh again.\p"
    .string "Let's see if your battling feels\n"
    .string "fresh too.$"

Route25_Text_BlakeDefeat::
    .string "Freshly beaten!$"

Route25_Text_BlakePostBattle::
    .string "Flowers near the shore grow hardy.\p"
    .string "They bend often, but they don't\n"
    .string "break easily.$"

Route25_Text_BethanyIntro::
    .string "This far from town, POKéMON learn\n"
    .string "to listen to their TRAINER.\p"
    .string "Too much wind and water otherwise!$"

Route25_Text_BethanyRematchIntro::
    .string "My POKéMON have been listening\n"
    .string "better every day.\p"
    .string "Let me hear how yours answer!$"

Route25_Text_BethanyDefeat::
    .string "Clear as a bell!$"

Route25_Text_BethanyPostBattle::
    .string "Good raising is a conversation.\p"
    .string "ROUTE 25 gives POKéMON plenty\n"
    .string "to respond to.$"
